      "name": "Brewery",
      "type": "dxcufgbs-player-bastions.facility",
      "sort": 100000,
      "title": {
        "show": false,
        "level": 1
      },
      "system": {
        "ref": "brewery",
        "category": "trade",
        "image": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/brewery.webp",
        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/brewery.webp",
        "description": "<p>Copper kettles, oak barrels and the smell of malt.</p><p>The brewery earns a little each turn and makes an Inn far more profitable. It can be expanded up to ten times: each expansion costs more than the last and brews a little more, but needs more brewers, who need beds, food and wages. From the second expansion on it brews more than its brewers cost.</p>"
      },
