        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/brickworks.webp",
        "description": "<p>Clay pits, drying sheds full of bricks and a smoking kiln.</p><p>Where there is no stone to cut, clay is dug and fired: bricks and tiles sell, and the Bastion's stone projects cost less. Like a quarry, it sells all it makes while nothing stone is being built, and earns more for it. Grown into brick and tile works, it sells more. The brickmakers live at the Bastion and draw wages.</p>"
      },
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
