        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/caravanserai.webp",
        "description": "<p>A walled inn for desert caravans round a courtyard with a well, arcades for the animals and storerooms for the goods.</p><p>Caravans stop here to rest and trade: tolls, rents and travellers, more merchants and an easier road (Accessibility +1). Grown into a grand caravanserai, exotic traders make it their stop. Desert or arid land only.</p>"
      },
