        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/charcoal-burners.webp",
        "description": "<p>Smoking clamps in the forest clearings, stacks of cut wood and a woodcrafter's lathe.</p><p>Charcoal for every forge, bark for the tanners, bowls and staves for the market: the forest's trade, sold every turn. Grown into a woodcrafters' clearing, it sells more. The burners live at the Bastion and draw wages. Forest only.</p>"
      },
