        "description": "<p>Caverns of crystal and glowing stone below the Bastion, with walkways for visitors and corners for artists.</p><p>People come from far to see them and pay to do it; the galleries earn gold, renown and travellers. Grown into a hall of glowing stone, they earn more and make the Bastion a better place to live. Underground only.</p>"
