        "description": "<p>A timber lodge where trappers bring their furs to be graded, baled and sent south.</p><p>In cold and arctic lands, furs are the trade: the lodge earns gold every turn and draws merchants. Grown into a fur company, it earns more. Its clerks and carters live at the Bastion and draw wages.</p>"
